# A paste waits for a held modifier, then sends when it goes up.
0 in sock connect
0 in key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down
0 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down
100 in sock paste
500 in key KEY_LEFTSHIFT up
500 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT up
500 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down
500 out key KEY_INSERT down
500 out key KEY_INSERT up
500 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT up
500 out sock pasted
